{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1521049-how-do-you-protray-racism-towards-novas","id":1521049,"title":"How do you protray racism towards Novas?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-20T12:13:51-07:00","id":1521049,"title":"How do you protray racism towards Novas?","content":"Racism is never an easy topic to tackle, even more if it's in a fictional setting. If you're not careful, you could end up making a joke of it or hurting the message you're trying to portray. The way racism works, it always targets those who have no power, precisely because they can't fight back. As such, in the world of aberrant, racism would have to manifest in different ways taking into account the power of Novas. Sure, there will always be those who would be open about it, but I believe that as a general rule it would be more subtle and insidious, small acts here and there to make their life more difficult. That said, I would like to hear your opinions on the topic and how you handle it. Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-20T12:38:51-07:00","id":1521053,"title":"","content":"Frankly I would not model the bigotry against Novas on Racism. In fact I'd look only at bigotries directed against the powerful and successful. These aren't often discussed, but they exist. Anywhere on Earth where you have a group seen as outsiders (and it is about perception not reality) and those outsiders are more financially successful than the general community certain patterns of bigotry show up.<br /> <br /> If you look at Jews in Europe and America, &quot;Overseas Chinese&quot; in most of Southeast Asia, Jamaicans in the African American neighborhoods of the USA, and South Asians in Africa, you see similar narratives of conspiracy, greed, and petty cruelty. Often the out groups become associated with the stories of the local culture's supernatural beings. Especially those that hide treasures. <br /> <br /> Novas, would be similar but distinctive. I assume the key idea would be &quot;Novas lack humanity.&quot; Often people in nations far weaker than the USA say things like &quot;You Americans understand machines but we understand people!&quot; Or &quot;You Americans are rich but we work hard!&quot; Similarly Novas would be assumed to be phonies and hollow spiritually. <br /> <br /> Run with those themes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-20T23:41:37-07:00","id":1521101,"title":"","content":"In Aeon era, I just highlite to players that after War(s) all humans talk about Novas as Aberrants, almost forgetting name Nova. In Aberrant era I would simply make the same - bigots would always say that any Nova 'is Aberrant in the making' - even if particular Nova is most virtues being on Earth. ( Pardon my direct parallel ) It's very much the same as homophobes says things like 'all Gays are deviants'. And 'always Aberrant' people are as delusioned as our modern homophobes. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-31-2023, 03:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-21T03:45:43-07:00","id":1521116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1521049-how-do-you-protray-racism-towards-novas?p=1521101#post1521101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In Aeon era, I just highlite to players that after War(s) all humans talk about Novas as Aberrants, almost forgetting name Nova. In Aberrant era I would simply make the same - bigots would always say that any Nova 'is Aberrant in the making' - even if particular Nova is most virtues being on Earth. (pardon my direct parallel) It's very much the same as homophobes says things like 'all Gays are deviants'. And 'always Aberrant' people are as delusioned as our modern homophobes. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-21T06:28:52-07:00","id":1521125,"title":"","content":"I really think the point of prejudice against Novas is more related to what Astromancer said and have virtually nothing to do with homophobia.<br /> <br /> I mean, it\u2019s not like if a Nova was born that way, or inherited the power from his family, but the Nova didn\u2019t fought for it and people without power (specially those that fought hard for little power) are usually offended by the \u201clucky\u201d ones.<br /> <br /> Add to that the fact the Novas go against the status quo, putting the rich and traditionally powerful against the wall, and they will use all they got to revert that.<br /> <br /> So Novas are not just suffering from prejudice from the people, but they are also suffering prejudice from the people in power. There will be no big company or government trying to convince people Novas are good, the only people fighting for Nova rights are the novas and their followers.<br /> <br /> In other words it\u2019s a mix of what women suffer in sports (nobody care about most of their championships or records, plus there are trans women athletes taking their records, not saying trans women are not women, but testicles help a lot with muscles, even after removed), with racism (people judging you by your appearance), the prejudice working class have against the riches (people judging you for not worthing the powers) and what poor white people are suffering (really poor white people, not middle class white people, they are pointed as if they had lots of advantages even not having enough to pay their own bills).<br /> <br /> Sure, novas have true powers and many can fight entire armies, but doing so only make it worse\u2026 maybe a open war against them\u2026 oh look\u2026 did they really become monsters or is it all prejudice?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-30T21:52:26-07:00","id":1521728,"title":"","content":"I would express it through envy, fear, adoration, assumptions of ability (I thought all Novas could fly). Or if you really want to be transgressive, take all the anti white and anti rich anti privalidge rhetoric and just dump it on the Novas. They have everything you want, and they just got it because they were lucky. Some of this turns into a wierd obsession for some, and turns into a sick form of worship. <br /> Anti-Nova bigotry should push Novas into radicalism and create the very monsters that the baselines were afraid of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-09T16:50:07-07:00","id":1522316,"title":"","content":"It occurs to me that the closest parallel to antinova bigotry would be anti Americanism. Opposition to what America has done is routinely cited by anti American types, but any examination of their writings shows that bigots (as opposed to those with a political beef) hate what America is and that America even exists. Any examination of Anti American discourse will show that the author feels limited or hemmed in by some fact about America or something associated with America.<br /> <br /> The French surrealist who said &quot;Europe has civilization, America has plumbing,&quot; gave his game away. He felt that technological change was destroying French society and culture. In a way he was right. France was a amazing 19th century nation. But in the early 20th century this put France in peril. Nazi Germany was monstrous but up to date. Although it was German arms that humiliated France, America was far more associated technology and the changes it brought.<br /> <br /> Germany, like French and British conservatives, saw the very existence of American democracy as a threat to their political stability. All through the 19th century German intellectuals constantly proclaimed America a fake. As late as 1912 a Noble laureate author from Germany offered the statement that &quot;American birds can't sing because there is no spirit of poetry in America,&quot; as a uncontested statement of fact.<br /> <br /> Novas are profoundly powerful and people are both afraid and jealous of powerful people. The 1ed sourcebook for the Directive has a Russian woman (she's a worked character) who proclaims the power of Novas is illegitimate. Why? Novas can't control having or not having the status of being a Nova. She saw only that power that was controlled by the state as legitimate. As with Anti Americanism, the power of the powerful is seen as illegitimate because it isn't under the control of those the bigot respect.<br /> <br /> Try this thought experiment. Picture I got into a spat with a Wishing Fay. (She was wearing a pink taffeta ball gown in the daytime so I couldn't take her seriously. ) She curses me with power and responsibility. Now I have the powers of a powerful fay and control of the USA.<br /> <br /> I decide, while I am trying to figure out long term plans and who to trust, to refill America's mines. The copper mines in Butte, the mines of the iron range (as copper has a better market half the mines will be copper instead of iron), and many other mines are newly productive, but only if the unions and their members get a fair shake. I decide to my sure that all the minerals needed for modern civilization in general (and renewable energy in particular) are plentiful in the USA. In my home state of West Virginia, I make sure that platinum and platinum group metals are common. Platinum group metals are the rarest metals vital for the green energy transition.<br /> <br /> I make sure to take all of these mineral resources from many miles deep into the mantel, far deeper than any mine is or could be with foreseeable technology. No other nation has fewer minerals, it's simply America has more.<br /> <br /> The upshot of this would be that I would be widely hated around the world. It wouldn't matter that no one was robbed or cheated, I would be universally condemned as a thief. People who see their economic status threatened would scream in fury. Nations that depend on being the main source of a rare mineral would want me dead.<br /> <br /> Novas, like my example, can radically change the game in unpredictable ways. Picture an impoverished Arab child raised in a refugee camp taught all his life that all is problems come from the West. He's taught that his faith (Islam) and his people (the Arabs) are in danger because of Western injustice. He has erupted as a Nova. He has low levels of Mega physical attributes, teleportation, invisibility, and rapid healing. He could become one of the most brutal terrorists ever. The very thought of those left out of society gaining Nova powers would be destabilizing.<br /> <br /> A Nova, that was good with tech before she erupted, who put her mega intellect to solving the problem of superconductivity so that non Nova scientists and engineers could make high temperature superconductors for things like power lines or power generation, would likely transform the world. No industry would be less than transformed. Such power terrifys. And what people fear, they hate.<br /> <br /> Anti Nova hate would be based on fear and jealousy. Especially fear of losing control, power, and status.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 09-10-2023, 03:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T05:48:52-07:00","id":1522342,"title":"","content":"Thank you all for your answers. You have given me lots of ideas on how to do it with nuance. I don't want it to make it a central theme in my games, but I don't want it to ignore it either. I just want to make the players aware that it exists without rubbing it in their faces.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}